@KredFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

### Register a lender and its first (owner) user
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "ABC Finance",
  "ownerName": "Ravi Kumar",
  "email": "ravi@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+919876543210",
  "password": "StrongPassword@123"
}

### Log in (seeded Development login: contact@annapoorna-finance.example / KredFlow@Dev2026!)
# @name login
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ravi@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword@123"
}

### Current user
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Lender profile
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lenders/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update lender profile (Owner only)
PUT {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lenders/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Sri Lakshmi Finance",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "address": "Chennai",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Kolkata"
}

### Deactivate lender (Owner only; irreversible through the API)
PATCH {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lenders/me/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Create customer
# @name createCustomer
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Meena Devi",
  "phoneNumber": "9123456789",
  "address": "Chennai"
}

###
@customerId = {{createCustomer.response.body.id}}

### Get customer
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List/search customers
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers?search=meena&isActive=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update customer
PUT {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Meena Sundaram",
  "phoneNumber": "9123456789",
  "address": "Coimbatore"
}

### Deactivate customer (use true to reactivate)
PATCH {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Customer loans
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Customer outstanding
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/outstanding
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create loan (EMI and schedule are calculated by the backend)
# @name createLoan
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "principalAmount": 100000,
  "annualInterestRate": 12,
  "tenureMonths": 12,
  "startDate": "2026-11-15",
  "prepaymentPolicy": "LenderChoice"
}

###
@loanId = {{createLoan.response.body.id}}

### Get loan
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List loans
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans?status=Active&minPrincipal=50000&maxPrincipal=200000&startDateFrom=2026-01-01&startDateTo=2026-12-31&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Repayment schedule
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Loan outstanding (asOfDate is optional)
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/outstanding?asOfDate=2026-12-15
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Prepayment (treatment is required for LenderChoice loans)
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/prepayments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 20000,
  "paymentDate": "2026-11-15",
  "treatment": "ReduceTenure",
  "paymentMethod": "BankTransfer",
  "remarks": "Additional principal repayment"
}

### Close loan (Owner only)
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "closureDate": "2026-11-15",
  "remarks": "All dues settled"
}

### Record a payment (interest due, then penalties, then principal due, then upcoming installments)
# @name recordPayment
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000,
  "paymentDate": "2026-11-24",
  "paymentMethod": "Cash",
  "referenceNumber": null,
  "remarks": "November EMI",
  "idempotencyKey": "payment-request-unique-001"
}

###
@paymentId = {{recordPayment.response.body.id}}

### Get payment (with allocations)
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Loan payment history
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/payments?status=Recorded&paymentMethod=Cash&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Customer payment history
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}/payments?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reverse a payment (Owner only)
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/reversals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Cheque bounced",
  "reversalDate": "2026-11-26"
}

### Assess a penalty (Owner only)
# @name assessPenalty
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/penalties
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500,
  "assessedDate": "2026-11-24",
  "installmentNumber": 1
}

###
@penaltyId = {{assessPenalty.response.body.id}}

### List penalties
GET {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/penalties
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Waive a penalty, fully or partially (Owner only)
POST {{KredFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/{{loanId}}/penalties/{{penaltyId}}/waivers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200,
  "reason": "Customer hardship"
}

###
